4,"Pahari-Potwari language. Evangelism tools, church planting resources...",https://globalrecordings.net/en/language/phr,"Pahari-Potwari language and dialect information.Short audio Bible stories and evangelistic messages that explain salvation and give basic Christian teaching. Each program is a customised and culturally relevant selection of scripts, and may include songs and music.",Pahari-Potwari,Indo-European
